        <p><span style="font-size:11px;color:#595959;font-weight:700">未来 数智化生态</span></p>
  - elementId: step-1-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 200, 160, 44]
    content:
      style: "$footnote"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, top]
      text: 成立于深圳，从代理起步转向自主研发
  - elementId: step-2-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [230, 200, 160, 44]
    content:
      style: "$footnote"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, top]
